# Line-ending rules that matter for this repo:
# verify.sh ships inside the Linux package and dies with a stray \r, so it must
# never be checked out with CRLF. PowerShell scripts are the opposite (Windows).
# README-linux.txt is read on the Linux box too, so it stays LF as well.
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.ps1  text eol=crlf
*.cmd  text eol=crlf
README-linux.txt text eol=lf
*.exe  binary
*.zip  binary
*.gz   binary
*.tar  binary
*.png  binary
